			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Level Up!"
			description: [
				"&dDang, it's been quite a while since we've looked into the FOP Game Servers..."
				""
				"&5Looks like they piled on even more things to keep you working..."
				""
				"&dOkay, looks like two major systems control most things: Vault Hunters is the FOP Game Server main system, and then under that is a lot of smaller things, but most of them have to be unlocked via Vault Hunters."
				""
				"&5We'll try to explain everything as we work it out ourselves, Bandit. A lot of the deeper systems are locked up still."
				""
				"&dWe'll change what we can to make it easier, but every time we do something overtly, the security system steps in and stops future attempts."
				""
				"&5We'll have to figure out a workaround. For now though, let's examine some of this stuff..."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
