			x: 4.75d
			y: -5.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "MOD: Vault Hunters"
			description: [
				"&5So this is the big one you'll have to deal with. The entire FOP Game Server is built around the &n&lVault Hunters&r&5 game."
				""
				"&dIt adds and changes so many things to a 'vanilla' game of Minecraft that the Game is based on."
				""
				"&5The Game Server is so expansive, it may as well BE the &n&lentirety of the FOP corporation&r&5 at this point. They do all their manufacturing through it, base their advertising from it..."
				""
				"&dHell, even some of their &n&lCEOs&r&d and &n&lboard of directors&r&d live IN the game."
				""
				"&5Right. For now, if you &n&lhit H&r&5 on your Keyboard, you'll bring up your &n&lVault Hunters GUI&r&5. You can access your &n&lstats and skills&r&5 here, as well as the Quests they give you."
			]
