		{
			title: "A Glitch....?"
			icon: "minestuck:sbahjarang"
			x: 6.25d
			y: -5.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "MOD: Minestuck"
			description: [
				"&7Huh, I'm vaguely remembering one of the first systems they had for the FOPGame Server...remember that?"
				""
				"&dOh right, back when they had that &n&linfinite mall&r&d thing, right? The systems they got when they 'acquired' the old &n&lSBURB active worlds&r&d. It probably got &n&lwiped ages ago&r&d when they got the Vault Hunters system online. You and I played it some and tried to crack it. How come, squeaks?"
				""
				"&7Well, I used one of those old tools we coded up and well... I think I found a &n&lglitched item&r&7 from a hole I poked. See?"
				""
				"&dWait. Wait a minute, you mean &n&lthey just... left in that old code&r&d? That's... really important. Bandit, I'll split this off into its own section. Come check out the &n&l\"BREAKING IN\" quest section&r&d. Squeaks, yer up."
				""
				"&7I'll take it from here, boss. Let's go Bandit, time to break some things."
			]
