		{
			title: "Of Skills and Preperation"
			icon: "minecraft:shulker_box"
			x: 3.75d
			y: 2.75d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Getting Ready"
			description: [
				"&5That's helpful. The &n&learly Vault Hunters quests&r&5 you can do, they give you &n&la free skill point and a Shulker Box&r&5 before you go into your first Vault."
				""
				"&dVery handy. With the Shulker Box, you can store more loot in it from inside the Vault, and the &n&lSkill Point can be get you some kind of healing&r&d."
				""
				"&5Whoops, thats an &n&limportant thing to note&r&5 to Bandit, sis. "
				""
				"&dWhat do....OH, yeah, we almost forgot. Bandit, &n&lwhen you are inside a Vault, you do not heal naturally&r&d. Something about how they are twisting the worlds also twists how regular things function."
				""
				"&5So things like &n&la full stomach won't regenerate health&r&5."
				""
				"&d&n&lI suggest choosing a Healing skill in your VH GUI (H Key by default)&r&d."
			]
