		{
			title: "The Altar"
			icon: "the_vault:vault_altar"
			x: 1.75d
			y: 2.25d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "A Sacrifice of Material"
			description: [
				"&5Hm, okay, if you haven't already Bandit, I'd get at least a &n&ltemporary base&r&5 set up. You'll need the &n&lstorage space&r&5."
				""
				"&dYou'll want a place to make your Vault Portal. And all your Vault work stations. You'll want your usual furnishings. Bed. Chests. A roof. "
				""
				"&5Some kind of defense turrets..."
				""
				"&dNot sure those are immediatley available, brother...not a bad idea however. Then you'll want to make yourself a &n&lVault Altar&r&d. This is your key to the Vaults."
				""
				"&5Looks like you &n&lplace the Altar down, and that one binds to you. Only you can place Vault Rocks onto it, which is how you start to make a Vault Crystal&r&5."
				""
				"&dThe &n&litems that show up&r&d? Those are the &n&l'price' to make the Vault Crystal. Throw them at the Altar&r&d, then put down a &n&lButton or Lever against the Altar and activate&r&d them to finish creating the &n&lVault Crystal&r&d."
