			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Mod: Lightman's Currency"
			description: [
				"&5Looks like the FOP include a &n&ltrading and banking system called Lightman's Currency&r&5."
				""
				"&dA lot of useful things here for trading with other Users. Trading terminals. Vending machines. Display stands."
				""
				"&5And &n&la slot machine&r&5? Isn't there another product they sell thats &n&lliterally casino games&r&5?"
				""
				"&dYeah that's a bit weird. But let me just... okay, that Wallet we gave you earlier, Bandit? It won't be able to store Ferret Dollars unfortunately. Maybe your bank account..."
				""
				"&2BANKING DATABASE UPDATED."
				""
				"&4SECURITY SYSTEM UPDATED FOR USER PROTECTION."
				""
				"&dDamn, I couldn't get the ATM to store Ferret Dollars either. That's not too bad, the Shipping Tablet can hold all your FMC until you are ready to spend."
