		{
			title: "Acidic Override"
			icon: "tfb2:blindboxblindbox"
			x: 5.5d
			y: -3.75d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "That was a test. So is this."
			description: [
				"&dWe've got a &n&lgood overview&r&d of the major systems in that Game, Bandit. "
				""
				"&5And we've come up with a good way to &n&lbreak into the entire system&r&5..."
				""
				"&d...&n&lfrom the inside&r&d. You know that &n&lBlind Box of Blind Boxes&r&d we gave you earlier? That was actually &n&la test&r&d box. I attached a tracking codespell on it and watched what happened with it."
				""
				"&5It's important because, like I said, we've not released that product yet. So my sister decided to see if we could &n&lhook the box up to the FOP Game Server itself&r&5."
				""
				"&dLayering so many systems made &n&lholes in their security&r&d, so I plugged one up with our &n&lown data pipe&r&d. So every one of those Blind Boxes you open up? Comes &n&ldirectly from their storage&r&d."
				""
				"&5Here. Send us &n&l5 Chromatic Iron&r&5 for another one. Then open it."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["40EA34C792B4864C"]
