		}
		{
			icon: "minestuck:amber_gummy_worm"
			x: 5.5d
			y: -1.75d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Infect the Server!"
			description: [
				"&dYes! &n&lSuccess&r&d! This is good, no security alerts, no tracked currency; I just need to edit the code a bit and..."
				""
				"&5Sis..."
				""
				"&dWhat? Oh, sorry Bandit! Okay, layferret's terms, the security hole we took over? &n&lThey don't see the pipes we installed&r&d. And as long as we don't transfer things TOO fast in and out, they never will."
				""
				"&5Until it's too late. So, Bandit, we're going to &n&lTrojan Horse&r&5 their entire system. But we have to do it &n&lslowly&r&d."
				""
				"&dThat's where you come in. These Blind Boxes will &n&lpull items from their storage server and give them directly to you&r&5. "
				""
				"&5Any &n&litems you collect&r&5 now, we're going to &n&l'infect' with a Worm&r&5, a little virus that will tag along with the item."
				""
				"&dWe call it the &n&lAudubon Worm&r&d. Fitting I feel, given the FOP are primarily &n&lbirds&r&d."
			]
			dependencies: ["04D5AA9EB9007560"]
