		{
			icon: "mcwlights:double_street_lamp"
			x: 5.5d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Two Paths, One Goal"
			description: [
				"&dOkay, so &n&linfecting the items and Vault Coins is step 1. Step 2? Get them back into the system of course&r&d."
				""
				"&5You have a &n&lchoice&r&5 here, Bandit. You can &n&lsell items and trade Vault Coins&r&5 back to FOP and purchase their AMAZINGLY priced DLC..."
				""
				"&d&n&lOr you can sell the items to us&r&d. We'll keep a portion of them, and &n&lsend the rest back&r&d into their system. &n&lThe Audubon Worm will very slowly spread&r&d without the FOP noticing."
				""
				"&5&n&lTake this TFB Shop Tablet&r&5. You can &n&lbuy a resources&r&5 from us, and &n&llearn how to sell to either us or the FOP&r&5."
				""
				"&dThe FOP's Vault Coins aren't too hard to earn... as long as you are vaulting. But we agree you could &n&lprobably sell to both parties&r&d. Some things you can only get with Vault Coins, or some luck with our Blind Boxes. We have to limit how much we can sell you directly, as well. &n&lUsing either or both, we get the Worm in their system&r&d."
				""
				"&dOkay, we're &n&lopening up the rest of the Q.U.E.S.T. sections&r&d to you, as well."
			]
			dependencies: ["65766106B865F4F9"]
			hide: true
			id: "14E05D152CF5C051"
