		{
			title: "Twisting Worlds"
			icon: "moa_decor_science:globoterraqueo"
			x: 3.4285714285714306d
			y: 3.4464285714285765d
			shape: "gear"
			subtitle: "Worlds, Gamefied"
			description: [
				"&dSo we haven't quite &n&lexplained what these Vaults are&r&d yet. It's kind of a doozy, I have to say."
				""
				"&5Well, I don't think its too hard to understand, sis. &n&lIt's like that movie&r&5, uh... the one with &n&lThe One&r&5 and the &n&lcomputer program government agents&r&5..."
				""
				"&d&n&lThe Matrix&r&d."
				""
				"&5Aye, that one. Except &n&lthe fake world the FOP created to control all the Power Users were real&r&5, they were just... &n&ldigitized and rearranged into a game. So each Vault is actually small parts of an actual world&r&5 they captured."
				""
				"&dSo you are saying &n&lall the loot&r&d..."
				""
				"&5Aye, &n&leverything 'important' is made to look like a some kind of game loot&r&5. Precious metals and gems become Carbon and Vault Gems. Real Weapons become Vault Weapons. Money become Vault Coins."
				""
				"&dI don't know if thats a brilliant or wonky way to explain it..."
			]
			dependencies: ["78B5BCD7C6C45779"]
