			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "And a Starting Gift"
			description: [
				"&dOkay Bandit, when you have your &n&lVault Crystal&r&d made, you'll need to make the &n&lVault Portal&r&d."
				""
				"&5It's just like the Nether Portal. &n&lA 4 wide, 5 tall frame of Vault Cobblestone. Or Vault Stone. Or Polished Vault Stone. Or Copycat Blocks&r&5. You can make the portal looking nice, it doesn't have to be those exact dimensions either."
				""
				"&dYou'll be using it a lot so that's always nice. After it's made, &n&lRight Click the Vault crystal onto the frame to open the portal, and step inside&r&d!"
				""
				"&5Once you do, &n&lyou'll be teleported to another world&r&5. And if you've been &n&lfollowing the Vault Hunter's quests&r&5, you should be given a Vault Sword and Shield to start you off."
				""
				"&d&n&lDon't leave the first room immediately&r&d! This is the Portal Room, &n&lit lets you prepare, as well as wait for other Users. Now hold those Unidentified items and Right Click with them&r&d!"
				""
				"&dOh! Let's also test if we can do this... you get to &n&lchoose one more piece of equipment&r&d."
			]
