		{
			title: "To Build the Gate"
			icon: "the_vault:bumbo_polished_vault_stone"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 1.5d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Preparing to Dial"
			description: [
				"&dOkay Bandit, you'll need to get started on the game loop, if we want any chance of getting a foothold with the Adubon Worm."
				""
				"&5Looking at the guide book they gave you, you'll need to &n&lget some more Chromatic Iron and some Vault Cobblestone&r&5."
				""
				"&dYep, also keep an eye out for &n&lDiamonds&r&d as well, Bandit. You'll need them and &n&lObsidian&r&d as well to start making &n&lVault Portals&r&d."
				""
				"&5If you are &n&lhaving trouble&r&5 finding any of these, we've piped some into the &n&lShop Tablet&r&5 supplies for sale."
				""
				"&d&n&lExcept the Obsidian&r&d. Some materials we're having problems getting for you."
				""
				"&5Oh! Also make sure you &n&lget a couple Vault Rocks&r&5! They &n&ldrop from the Vault Stone&r&5, you'll need a bunch."
			]
