		{
			title: "The Time of Your Life"
			icon: "botania:cosmetic_clock_eye"
			x: 8.75d
			y: 2.5d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Tick Tock Tick Tock"
			description: [
				"&dOnce you &n&lcross the arch into the first Hallway, the Vault Timer will start&r&d."
				""
				"&5You get &n&l25 minutes, by default, to \"Complete\" a Vault&r&5. And by Complete, you should see a thing at the &n&ltop of your view that talks about Elixir&r&5."
				""
				"&d&n&lEvery normal Vault has an \"Objective\"&r&d, a goal for you to aim for to get bonus rewards. &n&lSome stuff you can only GET by completing a Vault successfully&r&d."
				""
				"&5Hm, I remember the only Objective you could get would be touching these monolith things...but it looks like they changed it."
				""
				"&dYeah, now your &n&lfirst available objective is called Elixir Rush. Your goal is to fill up that bar with Elixir, which are these purple orbs that 'explode' out of enemies and chests&r&d."
				""
				"&5Reading into it, &n&leach monster and chest type will have different amounts&r&5 of Elixir. And it &n&lchanges every time you enter a new Elixir Rush Vault&r&5."
			]
			dependencies: ["249CEFD98AF2D014"]
			id: "1F2875BC889232AC"
			tasks: [{
				id: "01B9FE8410D5956E"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "06E098223A904086"
				type: "item"
				item: "the_vault:crystal_seal_sage"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Loot Loot Loot Loot"
			icon: "supplementaries:sack"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 2.0d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Fight! Loot! Loot! Fight!"
			description: [
				"&dOkay, &n&lhead on in&r&d, Bandit (if you haven't already, that is!). &n&lEvery Vault is sectioned off into a grid of large Rooms&r&d, all connected with in each cardinal direction."
				""
				"&5Except the &n&lPortal Room&r&5! This room &n&lonly has one entrance&r&5, and you'll want to &n&lremember where it is&r&5!"
				""
				"&d&n&lSome Objectives can only be completed if you exit out of the Portal&r&d here. Or, &n&lif you can't complete the Objective, you'll need to get out via this Portal to not 'fail'&r&d the Vault."
				""
				"&5&n&lFor now, failing will only damage your equipment a little bit&r&5. After Level 19 though..."
				""
				"&dWe can cover that later. For now, pay attention to the &n&lright side of your view, you have a Vault Map&r&d that'll fill in as you explore. You'll need something to climb up to higher areas easier though... Ideas, brother?"
				""
				"&5Well...here, &n&ltake these blocks&r&5. You can use them to &n&lpillar upwards&r&5. They should &n&lstand out nicely&r&5 as markers as well. Also, these special Unobtanium Blocks &n&lcan be crafted into Ingots... then back into a block... but you get an extra Ingot&r&5. So if you keep repeating that..."
			]
			dependencies: ["1F2875BC889232AC"]
			id: "5E574242513BE343"
