			x: 5.5d
			y: 2.75d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Abilities, Talents, and Expertise"
			description: [
				"&5Bad news, Bandit. &n&lYe won't have the same kind of Veinmining skill&r&5 ye had in yer previous world."
				""
				"&dThe &n&lFOP entwined  it and other useful skills into the Vault Hunters skill system&r&d, which is split into three types : "
				""
				"&5&n&lAbilities are yer activatable abilities&r&5. Throw a fireball, teleport, etc. The Veinmine skill activates while holding down the Vault Ability button and ye mine something."
				""
				"&d&n&lSecond type is Talents. These are passive buffs&r&d. More damage with certain abilities, faster mana regeneration, more damage at low health, etc."
				""
				"&5&n&lThird is Expertise&r&5. Ye only get &n&lone Expertise per 5 levels&r&5, so don't worry about em for now."
				""
				"&dThere should be items you can loot or craft that replicate Vein Mining or similar 'handy' functions..."
			]
