		{
			x: 6.196428571428569d
			y: -0.875d
			shape: "gear"
			subtitle: "Why So Slow?"
			description: [
				"&dSo why don't we just &n&ltake all items&r&d, tag em, and &n&ldump them back all at once&r&d?"
				""
				"&5&n&lVisibility&r&5."
				""
				"&dSee, we have to &n&ltreat the Audubon Worm&r&d like an actual, &n&lmutating virus&r&d. But from the 'bad' end of it, I guess."
				""
				"&5Like that &n&lone game&r&5 you showed me, sis. &n&lLevel up the virus slowly&r&5. It can't kill fast or it &n&ljust burns out or gets cured super fast&r&5 before it can spread enough."
				""
				"&dRight. If we hit them with &n&la big attack, they'll quickly see it and neutralize it&r&d. You saw how fast they countered me lowering that Chromatic Iron requirement earlier, yeah? Same thing."
				""
				"&5This is one reason &n&lwhy we are putting a price on things in our Shop&r&5. Infecting more things but at &n&la slower, steady pace&r&5. Sure, you could dump thousands of Cobblestone at once, but that stuff is cheap, so they wouldn't notice."
			]
