			description: [
				"&dThe FOP have added an &n&ladvanced movement system&r&d to their server that might interest you, Bandit. It's called &n&lParcool&r&d, and it lets you &n&lParkour&r&d around, whatever that actually means."
				""
				"&5Parkour is... basically, you go from point a to point b, except &n&linstead of going around stuff in your way, you go over it, under it, or through it instead&r&5, using it as leverage instead of a speed bump."
				""
				"&dAccording to this book, you can do stuff like &n&lwall kicks, climbing ledges, wall running, long jumps&r&d... but you have a &n&lStamina bar&r&d that recharges."
