			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "MOD : Curios"
			description: [
				"&dThe FOPGame Server adds a whole lot of &n&lequipment slots&r&d in the form of &n&lCurios&r&d."
				""
				"&5These &n&lused to be called Baubles&r&5 in previous versions of the game. But they are things like &n&lRings, Amulets, and other accessories&r&5 you can wear. Like the Wallet slot can &n&lhold that Wallet&r&5 we gave you."
				""
				"&d&n&lTo access your Curios equipment, open up your inventory&r&d. In the upper left of your character image, you will see &n&la little * looking symbol&r&d. Thats your Curios equipment page."
			]
