			description: [
				"Greetings, player! "
				""
				"Just so you know, the questlines in this Q.U.E.S.T. Tablet will repeat information presented to you by in-game documentation for their respective mods. Mods like Vault Hunters have built in quests and manuals you can access."
				""
				"But I'm repeating all that info here as part of the story, and to expand on that information as well."
