			description: [
				"&dLooks like you can change how hard or easy the mobs you fight inside the Vaults are."
				""
				"&5Oh? Different from the GameMode?"
				""
				"&dYeah, looks like the difficulty settings are more...granular. "
				""
				"&5How does that work for people you are partied with in a Vault?"
				""
				"&dLooks like the last person to enter the portal sets the difficulty."
				""
				"To set your local difficulty, do the following command : "
				"&6/the_vault local_difficulty your_name difficulty :&r Replace your_name with your minecraft name, and difficulty with one of the following. Each one increases the health and damage of mobs : "
				"    Piece of Cake"
