			description: [
				"&dWhen &n&llooking through the skills&r&d, Bandit, you &n&lcan see what every level of the skill does&r&d so you can plan out a build better."
				""
				"&5Hey sis, what are these levels that have the &n&lglitching icon in front of them&r&5?"
				""
				"&dOH, I forgot to mention! I kind of... untethered the skill cap for almost every skill. The problem is I &n&lcan't enable you to just add more levels to a skill than the normal amount&r&d."
				""
				"&5Ah. Is there another workaround then?"
				""
				"&dYup, bro. You won't find much at low level, Bandit, but &n&lhigher level gear has a higher chance of rolling +Levels to a skill&r&d. And if you happen to go over the normal 'max level', well you are now in &n&lOverLevel&r&d territory! Neat, huh?"
