			y: -0.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "It Wants HOW Many Apples?!"
			description: [
				"&5Bandit, as ye level up and craft more Vault Crystals, the amount of ingredients ye are required to gather will increase."
				""
				"&dYep, and the FOP have added a gamerule to change how fast these scale up in amount."
				""
				"&5Aye, if ye get overwhelmed with how much ye have to gather, ye'll stop running Vaults altogether. No shame in lowering this, Bandit, cause ye'll need resources from inside the Vaults to escape as well."
				""
				"If you want the scaling to go faster or slower : "
				""
				"&6 /gamerule vaultCrystalRecipeScaling scale:&r Replace scale with one of the following :"
				"    SLOW (0.5x)"
				"    NORMAL (1x)"
				"    FAST (2x)"
				"    EXTREME (3x)"
