		{
			title: "Sharing the Experience"
			icon: "minecraft:experience_bottle"
			x: 2.75d
			y: -1.75d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Your XP? No, Comrade, OUR XP!"
			description: [
				"&dIf you've arrived in the FOP Game Server with other Assistants, Bandit, you'll probably notice that the XP you each earn in a Vault Party is fairly different between each other."
				""
				"&5That's cause ye all get XP based on yer own actions : lootin, killin, etc. Yer own skills and builds can go faster or slower."
				""
				"&dThe FOP have a gamerule to change how XP is handled in Vault Parties. You can combine and split the XP evenly, or set it to match the highest or lowest player's earned XP."
				""
				"&6/gamerule vaultPartyExpSharing amount :&r Replace amount with one of the following :"
				"    AVERAGE (Average of combined XP)"
				"    HIGHEST (match highest XP gained)"
				"    LOWEST (Match lowest XP gained)"
				"    DISABLED (No share. Default)"
			]
			dependencies: ["4CA0844372B19F19"]
