			x: 4.0d
			y: -1.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Go No Further!"
			description: [
				"&dEarlier in the FOP Game Server, you had to do some file editing to set a level cap for your 'server', which was a great way to limit how fast some players could level so a friend group could stay at a similar level."
